                                "sense_id": "e4019e5e-5219-31cb-a4a1-d02403021708",
                                "text": "U.S. District Judge Paula Xinis said Wednesday she will extend her temporary restraining blocking his removal until Abrego Garcia's latest deportation challenge in court is resolved."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
